Article 2 (Publication of the Aeronautical Information Publication, etc.)
(1) The Publication shall be issued by the Minister of Land, Infrastructure and Transport. <Amended on March 14, 2008; March 23, 2013>
(2) The Publication issued under paragraph (1) shall contain the following matters, and the number of copies to be published shall be determined by the Minister of Land, Infrastructure and Transport: <Amended on March 14, 2008; March 23, 2013; January 2, 2019>
1. Matters concerning aerodromes and their ground support facilities;
2. Matters concerning aeronautical communications;
3. Matters concerning aeronautical meteorology;
4. Matters concerning air traffic control;
5. Matters concerning entry and departure of aircraft;
6. Matters concerning search and rescue services;
7. Matters concerning aeronautical charts;
8. Other matters concerning aeronautical information services.
(3) Changes or additions to the contents of a published Publication shall be issued in the form of amendments.
